        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Word 文档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pluginkit 无法执行，可能受沙盒限制。请在终端用 pluginkit -m -A -D -v -i 检查下列嵌入标识。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not run pluginkit, possibly due to sandbox restrictions. In Terminal, use pluginkit -m -A -D -v -i with the embedded identifier shown below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pluginkit 无法执行，可能受沙盒限制。请在终端用 pluginkit -m -A -D -v -i 检查下列嵌入标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pluginkit 查询成功，找到当前应用内扩展路径的注册记录。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pluginkit query succeeded and found a registration for the extension inside this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pluginkit 查询成功，找到当前应用内扩展路径的注册记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pluginkit 查询成功，未返回匹配记录。请从应用程序目录启动 QuickFile，再打开扩展管理。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pluginkit query succeeded with no matching records. Launch QuickFile from Applications, then open extension management."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pluginkit 查询成功，未返回匹配记录。请从应用程序目录启动 QuickFile，再打开扩展管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pluginkit 查询终止后未能确认退出。请在终端检查注册状态。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
