    "上一次自动打开仍在等待系统响应。请在 Finder 中打开此文件；如持续无响应，请重新启动 QuickFile 或 Finder。": {
      "comment": "Storage recovery or optional file opening: user-facing status, action, or explicit confirmation; do not imply that file creation failed or that requests resume automatically.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous automatic open is still waiting for the system. Open this file in Finder. If the operation remains unresponsive, restart QuickFile or Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一次自动打开仍在等待系统响应。请在 Finder 中打开此文件；如持续无响应，请重新启动 QuickFile 或 Finder。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次操作仍在结束。结束后可点击“重新检查”；关闭窗口不会强行中断磁盘操作。": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery: inspection/archive feedback. Archiving does not create a file or resume the queue.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous operation is still finishing. Click Check Again when it ends. Closing this window does not forcibly interrupt disk operations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次操作仍在结束。结束后可点击“重新检查”；关闭窗口不会强行中断磁盘操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次操作已结束。请重新检查当前队列；自动处理仍暂停。": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery: inspection/archive feedback. Archiving does not create a file or resume the queue.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous operation has ended. Inspect the current queue again. Automatic processing remains paused."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次操作已结束。请重新检查当前队列；自动处理仍暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
