    "不可用授权可能来自离线磁盘。可在“管理授权”中移除记录，不会删除文件；若无其他有效授权覆盖，再次使用时需重新授权。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics screen, including folder access management and extension health.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unavailable access may belong to an offline disk. Remove records in Manage Access without deleting files. If no other valid access covers the location, it must be authorized again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用授权可能来自离线磁盘。可在“管理授权”中移除记录，不会删除文件；若无其他有效授权覆盖，再次使用时需重新授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不能用导出文件覆盖 QuickFile 的配置、锁文件或恢复备份，请选择其他位置。": {
      "comment": "Template import/export: format validation, limits and duplicate-name handling.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An export cannot overwrite QuickFile settings, lock files, or recovery backups. Choose another location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不能用导出文件覆盖 QuickFile 的配置、锁文件或恢复备份，请选择其他位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
