    "临时目录初始化失败且清理未完成：%@。请检查此位置。%@ 清理错误：%@": {
      "comment": "Safe file creation: temporary-folder failure and cleanup guidance. Arguments (source order): 1 = local filesystem path (literal user data); 2 = initialization failure detail; 3 = cleanup failure detail.",
