    },
    "仅保存所选文件夹及其子文件夹的 Finder 创建权限，不会创建文件。可在“诊断”中撤销。无需完全磁盘访问。": {
      "comment": "Native file/folder selection or confirmation panel in the main app.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Finder access to this folder and its subfolders without creating a file. You can revoke access in Diagnostics. Full Disk Access is not required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保存所选文件夹及其子文件夹的 Finder 创建权限，不会创建文件。可在“诊断”中撤销。无需完全磁盘访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅取消了当前 Finder 创建请求，自动确认已暂停。其他待处理请求（如有）未被取消；点击“继续处理”后再逐个确认。": {
      "comment": "Main app: file creation or template-library operation feedback and recovery guidance.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the current Finder creation request was cancelled. Automatic confirmation is paused. Other pending requests, if any, remain queued. Click Continue to confirm them one at a time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅取消了当前 Finder 创建请求，自动确认已暂停。其他待处理请求（如有）未被取消；点击“继续处理”后再逐个确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅启用": {
      "comment": "Templates screen: library list, template actions and recovery dialogs.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
