            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在授权记录无法读取或保存时使用。权限修复不会更改书签，也不会为文件夹重新授权。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics: explains the limited purpose of the folder access storage maintenance actions.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use only if saved access records cannot be read or saved. Repairing permissions preserves the records and does not grant folder access again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在授权记录无法读取或保存时使用。权限修复不会更改书签，也不会为文件夹重新授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅复制状态、标识和计数，不含路径、错误原文、书签或模板内容。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics screen, including folder access management and extension health.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies only status, identifiers, and counts. Excludes paths, original error text, bookmarks, and template contents."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅复制状态、标识和计数，不含路径、错误原文、书签或模板内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅手动检查时连接 GitHub 及其下载服务；对方可见 IP 等连接信息。不会上传文件、路径、模板或剪贴板内容。": {
      "comment": "Community update settings privacy disclosure for manually requested GitHub release metadata.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual checks connect to GitHub and its download service, which can see your IP and connection details. Files, paths, templates, and clipboard contents are not uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅手动检查时连接 GitHub 及其下载服务；对方可见 IP 等连接信息。不会上传文件、路径、模板或剪贴板内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
