    "先在 Finder 中重新打开右键菜单，再检查响应。更新后可能仍有旧版扩展运行；请打开扩展设置，关闭再开启 QuickFile，然后重新检查。若仍未恢复，可在方便时重启 Finder。扩展进程由 macOS 管理，重开主 App 不保证重启扩展。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reopen the Finder context menu, then check the response. An older extension may still be running after an update. In extension settings, turn QuickFile off and on, then check again. If needed, restart Finder when convenient. macOS manages extension processes; reopening the main app does not necessarily restart the extension."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在 Finder 中重新打开右键菜单，再检查响应。更新后可能仍有旧版扩展运行；请打开扩展设置，关闭再开启 QuickFile，然后重新检查。若仍未恢复，可在方便时重启 Finder。扩展进程由 macOS 管理，重开主 App 不保证重启扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
