    },
    "原始记录已移至归档并移出待办，但未能完整确认归档的位置或持久化状态。不要重复归档本条记录；请先保留当前状态并检查本机存储。自动处理仍暂停，没有创建文件。": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery: inspection/archive feedback. Archiving does not create a file or resume the queue.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original was archived and removed from the queue, but the archive location or persistence could not be fully verified. Do not archive this record again. Preserve the current state and check local storage. Automatic processing remains paused and no file was created."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始记录已移至归档并移出待办，但未能完整确认归档的位置或持久化状态。不要重复归档本条记录；请先保留当前状态并检查本机存储。自动处理仍暂停，没有创建文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原目标文件夹已变化或无法确认身份，本次未创建文件。请从 Finder 重新发起创建。": {
      "comment": "File creation failure or completion warning.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original destination folder changed or its identity could not be verified. No file was created. Start creation again from Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原目标文件夹已变化或无法确认身份，本次未创建文件。请从 Finder 重新发起创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原配置已备份，但恢复写入失败：%@": {
      "comment": "Template library storage/recovery error. Preserve distinctions between missing, changed and damaged data. Arguments (source order): 1 = underlying error detail; it may follow the operating-system language.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original settings were backed up, but recovery writing failed: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原配置已备份，但恢复写入失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原配置文件已缺失，无法备份其原始内容。将先在本地保存缺失状态记录及可用的旧配置数据，再用“%@”恢复模板；保存记录失败则停止。这不是追加导入。": {
      "comment": "Main app: file creation or template-library operation feedback and recovery guidance. Arguments (source order): 1 = display name of the selected recovery source.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original settings file is missing, so its contents cannot be backed up. QuickFile will first save a local record of the missing state and any available legacy settings, then recover templates using “%@”. Recovery stops if that record cannot be saved. This replaces the configuration rather than appending templates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原配置文件已缺失，无法备份其原始内容。将先在本地保存缺失状态记录及可用的旧配置数据，再用“%@”恢复模板；保存记录失败则停止。这不是追加导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery panel: inspect and archive one problematic request. Template import/recovery preview before changes are applied. Template editor: fields, validation, content limits and unsaved drafts.",
