    "响应仅确认当前安装版本的扩展收到检查请求，不代表目录可写；未响应也不等于崩溃。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics screen, including folder access management and extension health.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A response confirms only that the installed extension received the request. It does not confirm folder write access. No response does not imply a crash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "响应仅确认当前安装版本的扩展收到检查请求，不代表目录可写；未响应也不等于崩溃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "响应仅说明当前安装路径及版本的扩展收到探针；未响应可能是旧版扩展仍在运行、扩展尚未运行、主线程忙或系统限制，不能据此判定崩溃。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics screen, including folder access management and extension health.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A response confirms only that the extension at the current install path and version received the probe. No response may indicate an older running extension, an extension that has not started, a busy main thread, or a system restriction. It does not establish a crash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "响应仅说明当前安装路径及版本的扩展收到探针；未响应可能是旧版扩展仍在运行、扩展尚未运行、主线程忙或系统限制，不能据此判定崩溃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
