      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archiving moves the selected original into a private hidden folder on this Mac and removes it from the queue. It does not delete the original. Cancelling leaves it unchanged. If the original cannot be safely preserved, QuickFile will not delete it instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "归档会把所选原件移入本机的隐藏私有目录，并将它移出待办；不会删除原件。取消确认不改动原始记录。无法安全保留原件时，不会用删除代替。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "归档保存在 QuickFile 共享容器的队列目录下 .recovery-archive 隐藏文件夹；关闭窗口不会删除归档。": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery panel: inspect and archive one problematic request.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archives are stored in the hidden .recovery-archive folder inside QuickFile’s shared request queue. Closing this window does not delete them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "归档保存在 QuickFile 共享容器的队列目录下 .recovery-archive 隐藏文件夹；关闭窗口不会删除归档。"
