    "授权覆盖所选目录及其子目录。移除只针对所选记录，不会删除文件；若另有同目录或父目录授权，该位置仍可能可写。重叠记录不会自动合并或移除。": {
      "comment": "Diagnostics screen, including folder access management and extension health.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access covers the selected folder and its subfolders. Removing a record does not delete files. Another grant for the same folder or an ancestor may still allow access. Overlapping records are not merged or removed automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权覆盖所选目录及其子目录。移除只针对所选记录，不会删除文件；若另有同目录或父目录授权，该位置仍可能可写。重叠记录不会自动合并或移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "授权记录权限已修复，原始书签未更改。请刷新授权列表；不可用目录仍需重新授权。": {
      "comment": "Storage recovery or optional file opening: user-facing status, action, or explicit confirmation; do not imply that file creation failed or that requests resume automatically.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization permissions repaired. Original bookmarks are unchanged. Refresh the list; unavailable folders may still need authorization."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权记录权限已修复，原始书签未更改。请刷新授权列表；不可用目录仍需重新授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
