    },
    "暂时无法访问 Finder 交接队列，自动处理已暂停。可重试读取；不会清空队列。": {
      "comment": "Main app: file creation or template-library operation feedback and recovery guidance.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder handoff queue is temporarily unavailable. Automatic processing is paused. You can retry reading; the queue will not be cleared."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时无法访问 Finder 交接队列，自动处理已暂停。可重试读取；不会清空队列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂时无法访问共享模板存储。请确认存储位置可用后重新加载模板。": {
