    "未能保存模板，当前修改未保存。请检查存储空间和访问权限后重试，或复制草稿。": {
      "comment": "Main app: file creation or template-library operation feedback and recovery guidance.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Templates could not be saved. Check storage space and access, then try again, or copy the draft."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能保存模板，当前修改未保存。请检查存储空间和访问权限后重试，或复制草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能完成权限修复。文件内容未更改，部分权限可能已调整。请在 Finder 的“显示简介 → 共享与权限”中检查当前用户的读写权限，再重试。": {
      "comment": "Failure after explicit storage permission repair. Partial permission changes are possible; contents remain intact.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permission repair could not finish. File contents were not changed; some permissions may have changed. In Finder, use Get Info → Sharing & Permissions to check your read and write access, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能完成权限修复。文件内容未更改，部分权限可能已调整。请在 Finder 的“显示简介 → 共享与权限”中检查当前用户的读写权限，再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能完成此次恢复操作。不会改用删除或清空队列；请保留原始数据并重新检查。": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery: inspection/archive feedback. Archiving does not create a file or resume the queue.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recovery operation could not be completed. QuickFile will not delete records or clear the queue instead. Keep the original data and inspect again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能完成此次恢复操作。不会改用删除或清空队列；请保留原始数据并重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能确认原因，退出码不能用于判断扩展是否已注册或启用。": {
      "comment": "Finder extension installation/registration diagnostics; evidence is not proof of successful creation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cause could not be confirmed. The exit code does not establish whether the extension is registered or enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能确认原因，退出码不能用于判断扩展是否已注册或启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能读取或领取 Finder 请求，自动处理已暂停。可重试读取；不会清空队列或重新执行已领取的请求。": {
      "comment": "Main app: file creation or template-library operation feedback and recovery guidance.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not read or claim a Finder request. Automatic processing is paused. Retry reading; the queue will not be cleared and claimed requests will not be repeated."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能读取或领取 Finder 请求，自动处理已暂停。可重试读取；不会清空队列或重新执行已领取的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未输入本次名称时使用；留空则使用“未命名”。按原文使用，不展开变量。": {
      "comment": "Template editor: fields, validation, content limits and unsaved drafts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used when no name is entered for this creation. Leave empty to use “Untitled”. Used literally; variables are not expanded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
