    "模板：%@\n目标：%@\n请求：%@\n确认后会保存所选文件夹及其子文件夹的 Finder 授权，后续创建也可使用；可在“诊断”中撤销。随后只继续本次请求，创建一个文件。取消仅取消当前请求，并暂停自动确认；其他待处理请求（如有）未被取消，需在 QuickFile 中点击“继续处理”后再逐个确认。只授权你需要的文件夹范围。": {
      "comment": "Folder authorization confirmation. Arguments: 1 = literal template display name; 2 = destination folder path; 3 = request UUID. Preserve the distinction between cancelling this request and pausing other requests.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Template: %@\nDestination: %@\nRequest: %@\nConfirming saves Finder access to the selected folder and its subfolders for future use. You can revoke it in Diagnostics. QuickFile then creates one file for this request only. Cancel stops this request and pauses automatic confirmation. Other pending requests, if any, remain queued; click Continue in QuickFile to confirm them one at a time. Grant access only to folders you need."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板：%@\n目标：%@\n请求：%@\n确认后会保存所选文件夹及其子文件夹的 Finder 授权，后续创建也可使用；可在“诊断”中撤销。随后只继续本次请求，创建一个文件。取消仅取消当前请求，并暂停自动确认；其他待处理请求（如有）未被取消，需在 QuickFile 中点击“继续处理”后再逐个确认。只授权你需要的文件夹范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
