    "请求标识（UUID）": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery panel: inspect and archive one problematic request.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request ID (UUID)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求标识（UUID）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求：%@": {
      "comment": "Finder request recovery panel: inspect and archive one problematic request. Arguments (source order): 1 = request identifier (UUID).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求：%@\n原因：%@\n\n确认后会把这一个原始记录移到本机的隐藏私有归档目录，使它不再等待处理。不会上传、自动重试或创建文件，也不会清空其他请求。无法安全保留原件时不会移除它。\n\n取消不改动原件。归档后自动处理仍暂停，需你另行点击“重试读取”。": {
      "comment": "Archive-one-request confirmation. Arguments: 1 = request UUID; 2 = localized failure reason. Archiving preserves the original locally; it neither deletes other requests nor resumes processing.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request: %@\nReason: %@\n\nConfirming moves this one original record to a private hidden archive on this Mac, so it no longer waits for processing. Nothing is uploaded, retried automatically, or created, and no other requests are cleared. The record will not be removed if its original cannot be safely preserved.\n\nCancelling leaves the original unchanged. Automatic processing remains paused after archiving; click Retry Reading separately to resume."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求：%@\n原因：%@\n\n确认后会把这一个原始记录移到本机的隐藏私有归档目录，使它不再等待处理。不会上传、自动重试或创建文件，也不会清空其他请求。无法安全保留原件时不会移除它。\n\n取消不改动原件。归档后自动处理仍暂停，需你另行点击“重试读取”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
